      desc = Bovista pila (tumbling puffball). A dark brown puffball, it starts out white. Known from across North America and Hawaii. It's also been reported from Russian (Sakha Republic), the Galapagos Islands, Brazil, and Turkey - though these all have varying amounts of credibility.
    {Mushroom^0.5|Puffball|Tumbleball}^[((Base == "ChocolateTort" || Base == "Cream") && (White != "HighWhite")) && (NorthAm || Europe)]
      desc = Bovista plumbea (tumbling puffball, tumbleball, or paltry puffball). A puffball mushroom that may be light cream or mottled with brown. Common in Western Europe and California.
