      desc = Calvatia craniiformis (brain puffball, skull-shaped puffball). A wrinkled creamy or light grey puffball. In Asia, it has been recorded from China, India, Indonesia, Japan, Malaysia, and South Korea. The brain puffball has been recorded from Australia. In North America, its range includes the eastern and southern United States, and Mexico.
