      desc = Handkea utriformis (mosaic puffball). A white puffball that becomes grey-brown as it matures. It is found in Europe, continental Asia, Japan, eastern atlantic North America, Mexico, and South Africa. It has also been collected in Chile, and New Zealand.
    //Chlorophyllum
