      desc = Chlorophyllum molybdites (green-spored parasol, false parasol, green-spored lepiota, vomiter). A light mushroom with a creamy stem and creamy mottled cap. Found in North America. Also reported from other tropical regions, such as Brazil, the Philippines, Tahiti, Central Africa, and across Central America and the Caribbean region ; Scotland, Australia, and Cyprus.
