      desc = Coprinus comatus (shaggy ink cap, lawyer's wig, shaggy mane). A light mushroom that starts out fully white, with a cap that turns black as it matures. Occurs widely across Europe and North America, and introduced into Australia, New Zealand, and Iceland.
    {Mushroom^0.5|Inkcap}^[(Base == "White" || ((White == "HighWhite" || Albino == "Point") && (Base == "Black" || Base == "BlackTort" || Base == "Fawn" || Base == "FawnPoint"))) && (NorthAm || Europe || British || EastAs)]
