      desc = Cortinarius cinnamomeus (cinnamon webcap). A light brown mushroom with an orange stem. The fruit bodies of Cortinarius cinnamomeus are common in damp places in coniferous forests, growing not only in Europe but apparently throughout the temperate zone of the northern hemisphere. It has also been collected from Yunnan Province, China.
