      desc = Mythicomyces corneipes. An orange mushroom with a brown stem. It has been recorded from North America, where it is most common in the Pacific Northwest region, and Europe, where it is rare, but widespread across the northern part of the continent.
    //Neohygrocybe
    {Mushroom^0.5|Waxcap}^[((Base == "Blue" || Base == "BlueTort" || Base == "Lilac" || Base == "LilacTort") && (Albino == "Point" || Albino == "Mink" || White == "MidWhite" || White == "HighWhite")) && (Europe || British)]
