    //Oudemansiella
    {Mushroom|Slimecap}^[(Base == "White") && (NewZeal || Australia || SEastAs)]
      desc = Oudemansiella australis (porcelain slimecap). A white mushroom with a wide cap. Found in New Zealand, Australia and Papua New Guinea.
