      desc = Sarcomyxa serotina (olive oysterling, late fall oyster, late oyster mushroom). A dark green mushroom with pale yellow gills. Found in Europe and North America.
    {Mushroom^0.5|{Huangmo|Yuanmo|Dongmo}|Mukitake}^[((Base == "Red") && White != "HighWhite" && Albino == "Normal") && (EastAs || Japan)]
      desc = Sarcomyxa edulis (元蘑/yuanmo, 黄蘑/huangmo, 冻蘑/dongmo, mukitake). A fan-shaped golden mushroom with a pale underside. Found in in China, Japan, and the Russian Far East.
    //Parasola
