    {Mushroom^0.5|Rootshank}^[(Base == "Red" && White == "NoWhite" && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm || Europe)]
      desc = Phaeocollybia christinae (Christina's rootshank). Orange mushroom. Found in Europe and eastern North America.
