      desc = Volvariella bombycina (silky volvariella, silky sheath, silky rosegill, silver-silk straw mushroom, tree mushroom). White mushroom with pink gills, it has a variant with a yellow cap. Reported from Asia (Iran, China, India, Korea, and Pakistan), the Caribbean (Cuba), Australia, Europe, North America, and South America.
