      desc = Aureoboletus mirabilis (admirable bolete, bragger's bolete, velvet top). Brown mushroom with yellow pores. Found in Pacific Coast Ranges from Northern California to Alaska, the Cascade Range, as well as Manitoba. Also found in Taiwan and Japan.
