    {Mushroom^0.5|Bolete}^[((Base == "Purple" || Base == "LilacTort") && (White == "MidWhite" || White == "HighWhite" || Albino != "Normal")) && (NorthAm || MidAm || SouthAm || EastAs || SEastAs || Australia || NewZeal || Islands)]
      desc = Boletellus ananas (pineapple bolete). Purple and white or purple and yellow mushroom with a white stem. Its North American distribution encompasses a range extending north from North Carolina to Florida, west to Texas and south to Mexico, and Central America. Reported in the Upper Potaro and Upper Ireng River Basins in Guyana. It has also been collected from New Zealand, Asia (including China, Korea, Malaysia, and Taiwan), and possibly Australia.
