      desc = Boletus aereus (queen bolete, dark cep, bronze bolete). Black or dark grey mushroom with an orange stem and white pores. Found mainly in central and southern Europe as well as north Africa. Found in several island ecosystems, including Sicily, Corsica, Cyprus, Lesvos, and Naxos. Rarer in colder climates like England.
    {Mushroom^0.5|Bolete}^[((Base == "Cinnamon" || Base == "CinnamonTort") && (Albino != "Normal" || White == "MidWhite" || White == "HighWhite")) && (NorthAm)]
