    {Mushroom^0.5|Bolete}^[((Base == "Cinnamon") && (Albino == "Normal" || White == "MidWhite" || White == "HighWhite")) && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Boletus nobilis (noble bolete). Light brown mushroom with a white stem. Found in the East Coast of the United States: Appalachia, Pennsylvania, Ohio.
