      desc = Xerocomus illudens. Cream musroom with yellow pores. In North America, its distribution extends from eastern Canada south to South Carolina, and west to Alabama and Minnesota. It has also been recorded in India, from Ramna Forest in the Burdwan District of West Bengal, and in the Himalayas.
    {Mushroom^0.5|Bolete}^[((Base == "Cinnamon") && Albino == "Normal" && (White == "NoWhite")) && (Europe || British)]
