      desc = Xerocomus subtomentosus (suede bolete, brown and yellow bolete, boring brown bolete, yellow-cracked bolete). Pale yellow to brown mushroom with a light orange stem. Found throughout Eurasia, North America and Australia. Has been recorded from the vicinity of Tangier in Morocco.
