    {Mushroom^0.5|Bolete}^[((Base == "Red") && (Albino != "Normal" || White == "HighWhite" || White == "MidWhite")) && (NorthAm || MidAm || SouthAm)]
      desc = Boletinellus monticola. Golden mushroom with orange pores and white stem. In North America, can be found in Southern Mexico. Stretching into South America, found in Argentina, Bolivia, Colombia, Costa Rica, and Ecuador.
