      desc = Astraeus hygrometricus (hygroscopic earthstar, barometer earthstar, false earthstar). Brown mushroom with a white bulb in the middle. Suggested to be limited to Europe between Southern France and Turkey, as populations elsewhere have since been reclassified as other species.
    {Mushroom^0.5|Earthstar}^[((Base == "BlueTort") && Albino == "Normal" && (White == "LowWhite")) && (EastAs)]
