    {Mushroom^0.5|Earthstar}^[((Base == "Cream") && (Albino != "Normal" || White == "MidWhite")) && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Astraeus morganii. Cream mushroom with white bulb. Found in the central to southern United States, extending southwards to Mexico.
    {Mushroom^0.5|Earthstar}^[((Base == "BlueTort") && Albino == "Normal" && (White == "MidWhite")) && (NorthAm || SouthAm || Islands)]
      desc = Astraeus pteridis (giant hygroscopic earthstar). Grey, red-tipped, fungus with a white, cream-coloured-tipped, bulb. Found in the Pacific Northwest region of North America. Also been found in the Canary Islands, Madeira, and Argentina.
    {Mushroom^0.5|Earthstar}^[((Base == "Cream") && Albino == "Normal" && (White == "NoWhite")) && (SEastAs)]
