    {Mushroom^0.5|Spikecap}^[((Base == "Pink") && (Albino != "Normal" || White != "NoWhite")) && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Gomphidius nigricans. Pinkish mushroom with a white stem. Found in eastern North America to as far west as Michigan.
        {Mushroom^0.5|Spike|Gomphidius}^[((Base == "Cinnamon") && (Albino != "Normal" || White == "HighWhite")) && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Gomphidius oregonensis (insidious gomphidius, blackening slime spike). White mushroom with an brown cap. Found in western North America, most commonly on the Pacific Coast.
