      desc = Hygrophoropsis aurantiaca (false chanterelle). Yellow mushroom with a lighter-rimmed cap. Found in Europe and North America. In North America, it can be found on the West Coast. It can be found in Central and South America, and Mexico. It has also been recorded in northern Asia, Australia and New Zealand. 
