    {Mushroom^0.5|Coral}^[(((Base == "Red" && Rufous == "Low") || (Base == "Cream" && Rufous == "High")) && (White == "MidWhite" || White == "HighWhite" || Albino != "Normal")) && (NorthAm || EastAs)]
      desc = Ramaria rasilispora (yellow coral). Pale yellow coral fungus with a white base. Common in western North America, its range extends south to Mexico and north to Alaska. Has been found growing in the Himalayas.
