    Lichen^[(((Base == "Red" && Rufous == "Low") || (Base == "Cream" && Rufous == "High")) && White == "NoWhite" && Albino == "Normal") && (Europe || British)]
      desc = Caloplaca marina (orange sea lichen). Golden lichen growing on rocks. It is distributed along the coastline throughout the Scottish mainland and islands, Ireland, England and Wales. It is also found throughout Atlantic Europe; English Channel; North Sea; and North West Europe.
    {Lichen|Jewel}^[(((Base == "Red" && Rufous == "Low") || (Base == "Cream" && Rufous == "High")) && White == "NoWhite" && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Caloplaca saxicola (rock firedot lichen, jewel lichen, rock jewel lichen). Golden lichen growing on rocks. Occurs in northern North America.
