      desc = Cetraria aculeata (spiny Iceland lichen). A greenish-yellow and orange-brown shrub-like lichen. Found across boreal and arctic regions, as well as at high elevations.
    Lichen^[(((Gold != "None" && !Silver && Agouti == "Tabby") || (Base == "Red" && Rufous == "Low") || (Base == "Cream" && Rufous == "High")) && White == "NoWhite" && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Cetraria arenaria (sand-loving Iceland lichen). A yellowish shrub-like lichen. Grows on soil from the New England states across to the Northern Great Plains.
