      desc = Cetrelia cetrarioides. A yellowish-green shrub-like lichen. It is native to Eurasia and Northern America.
    Lichen^[(Base == "Green" && White == "NoWhite" && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm || Europe || EastAs || Japan || Islands)]
      desc = Cetrelia chicitae. Pale green lichen growing on rocks and trees. In east Asia it has been found in Korea, Japan, and Sakhalin. Its North American distribution extends from New Brunswick west to southern Ontario and south to Tennessee and North Carolina. It has been recorded from various locales in Europe, although it is relatively uncommon there.
    Lichen^[(Base == "Green" && White == "NoWhite" && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm || Europe || WestAs || EastAs)]
