    {Lichen|Moss}^[(Base == "White") && (NorthAm || MidAm)]
      desc = Cladonia evansii (Evans' deer moss, Evans' reindeer moss). Off-white green lichen growing in balls made up of thin tendrils. It is found in the Southeastern United States, with a few instances in Cuba.
    Lichen^[(Base == "Green" && White == "NoWhite" && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm)]
