    //Montanelia
    Lichen^[((Base == "Blue" || Base == "Lilac") && (White == "NoWhite") && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm || Europe)]
      desc = Montanelia disjuncta (mealy camouflage lichen). Grey lichen growing on rock. Found in North America and Europe.
    Lichen^[((Base == "Green") && (White == "NoWhite") && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm || Europe)]
      desc = Montanelia panniformis (shingle camouflage lichen). Green lichen growing on rock. It is widely distributed in Europe, having been reported in 23 countries there. In North America, its scattered range extends north to Alaska and the Northwest Territories, and a single location in Baja California, Mexico.
    Lichen^[((Base == "BlackTort" || Base == "BlueTort") && (White == "NoWhite") && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm || Europe)]
