    Lichen^[((Base == "Black" || Base == "Chocolate") && (White == "NoWhite") && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm || Europe || WestAs || EastAs)]
      desc = Montanelia tominii (dimpled camouflage lichen). Brown to black lichen. Recorded in North America, Europe, and Asia.
    //Multiclavula
    Lichen^[((Base == "Green") && (White == "LowWhite") && Albino == "Normal") && (NorthAm || SouthAm || Europe || British || WestAs || EastAs || Australia || NewZeal)]
      desc = Multiclavula mucida. Green lichen with white fruiting bodies. Found in Asia, Europe, North and South America, Australia (including Tasmania), and New Zealand.
