      desc = Myriospora molybdina. Dark brown/black lichen growing on rock. Found across the Arctic, including northern Norway, Greenland, Svalbard, the Russian Arctic, and Alaska.
    Lichen^[(Base == "White" || Base == "Cream") && (Europe || WestAs)]
      desc = Myriospora myochroa. Pale cream lichen growing on rock. Found scattered in Europe, into Siberia and parts of Central Asia.

