      desc = Placopsis lambii (pink bull's-eye lichen). White lichen with red or brown spots, growing on rock. Recorded from many countries in Europe, Africa (Kenya, Lesotho, and Tanzania), South America (Bolivia, Chile), Central America (Costa Rica, Ecuador), New Zealand, and Asian Russia.
    //Platismatia
