      desc = Platismatia lacunosa. White bushy lichen with brown edges growing on bark. Found in Asia, Europe, and western North America. Recorded from the Commander Islands in the Russian Far East.
    Lichen^[(Base == "Green" && (White == "NoWhite") && (Albino == "Normal")) && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Platismatia stenophylla. Pale green leafy lichen growing on bark. Found in western North America, from Vancouver Island south to central California.
    Lichen^[(Base == "Green" && (White == "NoWhite") && (Albino == "Normal")) && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Platismatia tuckermanii. Pale green leafy lichen growing on bark. Found in Canada and the Southeastern United States.
    Lichen^[((Base == "Green" || Base == "Black" && Agouti == "Tabby") && (White == "NoWhite") && (Albino == "Normal")) && (NorthAm)]
      desc = Platismatia wheeleri. Pale green leafy lichen with a brown underside. Found in arid inland Western North America.
