    Lichen^[(Base == "White") && (NorthAm || MidAm || SouthAm || Europe || NorthAf || SouthAf || WestAs || EastAs || Australia)]
      desc = Polyblastidium hypoleucum (cupped fringe lichen). White branching lichen growing on bark. Found on all continents except Antarctica.
