      desc = Porpidia crustulata (concentric boulder lichen). White lichen with black spots growing on bark. Found in the Americas, Africa, Eurasia, Australia, and Greenland.
    Lichen^[(Base == "BlackTort" && (White == "NoWhite" || White == "LowWhite") && (Albino == "Normal")) && (NorthAm || Europe || British)]
